<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I’ve got a river of life flowing within me;</l><l>It started gushing up when God set me free.</l><l>That I keep the flow is my only plea.</l><l>I’ve got a river of life springing within me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Once I call His name there’s a flow within;</l><l>It turns me from my day, makes Him Lord again.</l><l>As my spirit burns, Satan cannot win.</l><l>Calling, “Oh Lord Jesus,” keeps the flow within.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
